00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:56.438
MYLES BORINS: Well, first
of all, I'm no scrub.

00:20:56.438 --> 00:20:57.390
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Oh.

00:20:57.390 --> 00:20:58.752
MARK MANDEL: Ugh.

