Please continue.

00:21:06.563 --> 00:21:07.270
MARK MANDEL: Also
showing our age.

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:07.600
FRANCESC CAMPOY:
Please continue.

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:08.900
MARK MANDEL: Yes, yes.

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:12.080
Yes, just creep along.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:14.240
MYLES BORINS: So on top
of not being a scrub,

00:21:14.240 --> 00:21:16.040
Google's investing a
