00:26:10.470 --> 00:26:11.386
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Cool.

00:26:11.386 --> 00:26:12.660
What about Node itself?

00:26:12.660 --> 00:26:15.900
What are the things that are
coming up with Node that you

00:26:15.900 --> 00:26:17.070
